/T (structured format for analysis.It involve task such as handling missing values, filtering data, and re shaping datasets. Data preprocessing, on the other hand, is a broader trem that includes all steps taken brfore appplying machine learning algorithms, including data wrangling, feature scalling, encodingcategorical data, and slpiting datasets. In simple terms, data wrangling mainly focuses on cleaning and transforming data , while data preprocessing includes additional steps required to prepare data specifically for modeling.)
